      sentence: "1) Marine scientists often observe that the sea is regulated mostly out of sight, so damage accumulates for years before it becomes visible on a beach or a dinner plate.（海洋科学家常说，海洋的治理大多发生在视线之外，因此损害会累积多年，才会在海滩上或餐桌上显现。）observe that 宾语从句中含 so 引导的结果分句；before 引导时间状语，强调滞后性。\n2) A coalition of small island states has campaigned for an international levy on deep-sea extraction and shipping emissions, arguing that those who profit from the sea should pay for its protection.（一个小岛国联盟一直在推动对深海开采和航运排放征收国际税费，主张从海洋获利者应为保护海洋买单。）arguing that... 现在分词作伴随状语，内含 who 定语从句，是典型的长难句套叠。",
